  "prefLabel": "Emab 202.12 Transfer of Records",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Emab 202.12 Transfer of Records. After 60 days has elapsed from the date of the mailing of the final decision by the board, the records, transcript, and all other papers, except for the decision in the case, shall be transferred to the department.\n\nSource. #10394, eff 8-9-13",
